[TITLE]
The per-feature base network of the EPANET quality parity (tests/verification/test_water_quality.py):
a reservoir source R1 (1 mg/L), a loop, a tank that fills, drains and fills, a dead end, a TCV and a pump.
Later tests edit it by these names.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand  Pattern
 J1   20    2
 J2   20    4
 J3   20    3
 J4   20    10      DAY
 J5   20    0
 J6   15    3
 J7   30    2

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[TANKS]
;ID   Elev  InitLevel  MinLevel  MaxLevel  Diameter  MinVol
 T1   80    5          0.5       10        12        0

[PIPES]
;ID   Node1  Node2  Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
 P1   R1     J1     1000    300       120        0          Open
 P2   J1     J2     600     200       120        0          Open
 P3   J2     J3     500     150       120        0          Open
 P4   J3     J1     700     200       120        0          Open
 P5   J3     J4     1500    150       120        0          Open
 P6   J4     T1     400     150       120        0          Open
 P7   J2     J5     300     100       120        0          Open

[PUMPS]
